"""Paper 2 · Unit 6 · P2-U6-08 Memory Management (2 sub-topics × 30).
Coverage (planner): contiguous allocation, swapping, paging, segmentation.
References: Silberschatz, Galvin & Gagne, Operating System Concepts (10th ed., ch. 9); William Stallings, Operating Systems.
Each set mixes REAL previous-year questions (exact wording and printed option order, `source` = paper and question number) with new
ones. Official answers come from KEA's final key for the Legislative Council Secretariat 2024 Junior Console Operator P2 (booklet
A1; final key 09-04-2025). KSET 2023/2025 and KEA 2026 questions are reused from packs/pyq-p2.json; those and the PGCET answers were
worked out by ExamSim. Virtual-memory questions (demand paging, page replacement, thrashing) are kept for P2-U6-09."""
